  Object.assign(entries,{'法力费用 -1；连击阶梯按调整后的费用判断。':'Mana cost -1; the adjusted cost determines combo order.','法力费用 +1；可衔接更高费用的连击。':'Mana cost +1; use it at a higher step in a combo.','伤害倍率 2；多枚伤害倍率宝石相加。':'Damage multiplier 2. Multiple damage gems add their multipliers.','伤害倍率 3；多枚伤害倍率宝石相加。':'Damage multiplier 3. Multiple damage gems add their multipliers.','出牌不消耗法力；保留卡牌费用作为连击阶梯。':'Play without spending mana. The card keeps its combo cost.','下一张牌可沿费用阶梯向上或向下继续连击。':'The next card can continue the combo one cost higher or lower.','卡牌主要效果后抽 1 张牌；此附加效果不乘连击。':'Draw 1 after the main effect. This bonus does not scale with combo.','卡牌主要效果后获得 2 护甲；此附加效果不乘连击。':'Gain 2 armor after the main effect. This bonus does not scale with combo.','主武器槽位':'Weapon sockets','继承宝石':'Inherited gems','辅助卡上的宝石将丢失':'Support gems will be lost','没有空宝石槽':'No empty socket','宝石不兼容':'Incompatible gem','宝石槽已满':'No empty socket','法力不足，不能打出':'Not enough mana to play','墙壁挡住了去路':'A wall blocks the way','暂时无法操作':'Action unavailable'});
  Object.assign(entries,{'点击卡牌释放 · 也可拖入战场 · 自动索敌':'Click to play · Or drag into the arena · Auto-target','自动索敌':'Automatic targeting','点击卡牌或拖入战场释放':'Click a card or drag into the arena','点击卡牌即可释放，也可拖入战斗区域松开释放。攻击自动索敌；拖到战场以外会取消。费用显示在卡牌左上角；没有任何可出的牌时自动结束回合，零费牌仍可使用。':'Click a card to play, or drag it into the arena and release. Attacks target automatically. Dropping outside cancels. Costs appear at the top left. The turn ends automatically when no card is playable; zero-cost cards remain usable.','请等待当前阶段结束':'Wait for this phase to finish','这张牌不在手牌中':'This card is not in your hand','请先选择存活的敌人':'No living enemy available','宝石与这张牌或已有宝石不兼容':'Gem is incompatible with this card or its gems','同一张牌不能重复镶嵌这颗宝石':'This gem cannot be socketed twice on one card','这颗宝石尚未开放':'This gem is not available','未知卡牌':'Unknown card','已达到此卡的槽位上限':'Maximum sockets reached','金币不足':'Not enough gold','请先靠近物品':'Move closer to the object','物品被墙壁挡住了':'A wall blocks the object','这里已经没有物品':'The object is gone','这里没有可交互的物品，继续探索吧':'Nothing to interact with here. Keep exploring.','守关者的封印尚未解除':'Defeat the guardian to break the seal','这里已经探索完毕':'This location is cleared','材料不足，或主武器没有空槽':'Missing ingredients or no empty weapon socket','不能移除当前角色卡':'The active character card cannot be removed','需要 ':'need ','当前 ':'current '});
  Object.assign(entries,{"W 万能牌零耗蓝，接续当前连击，也允许下一张任意费用接续。可通过地图拾取、石像掉落、升级或商店获取。启用“万能增幅”后，拾取万能牌的数值效果随连击增强；翅膀减费固定为1。": "W cards cost no mana, bridge the current combo, and let the next card chain at any cost. Find them on maps, in statue drops, level choices, or shops. With Wild Strength, pickup effects scale with combo; Wings always reduces cost by 1.", "WASD移动，Q/E转向，碰撞触发交互。法力与护腕推车先破坏再拾取，分别提高本局起始法力与抽牌数。普通容器掉金币或鸡肉，石像可能掉万能牌。普通宝箱先撞开露出100金币，再向前一步拾取；每层遗忘祭坛可免费删一张牌。新局共五层，地图与难度逐层增加；完成守关战后用铲子下层，击败最终守关者通关。": "WASD moves, Q/E turns, Move into objects to interact. Break and collect mana or bracer carts for run-long starting mana or draw bonuses. Containers drop gold or chicken; statues may drop Wild cards. Bump to open ordinary chests, then step forward again to collect 100 gold. Each floor has a shrine offering one free card removal. New descents have five increasingly large and difficult floors. Dig down after each guardian and defeat the final guardian to win.", "击败敌人获得经验并升级选卡。玩家回合有空位时新牌立即入手，本回合免费打出一次；手满则按原费用进入抽牌堆。黄色技能牌增加属性，也是指定攻击牌的进化材料。查看牌组中的“合成图鉴”可查配方。": "Enemy XP grants level-up card choices. With hand space on your turn, the new card is free once that turn; otherwise it enters the draw pile at its usual cost. Yellow skills grant stats and serve as evolution ingredients. Open the recipe index in View deck to inspect formulas.", "Antonio、Imelda、Arca 与 Poe 各自拥有5张起始牌。前四层守关者之后，可在配方进化、新卡牌、镶嵌宝石中选择一项。进化消耗材料，继承主武器的宝石与槽位，不占宝石槽。商人扩槽每次100金币，每种卡本局最多两次。": "Antonio, Imelda, Arca and Poe each start with a unique five-card deck. After the first four guardians, choose evolution, a new card, or a socketed gem. Evolution consumes ingredients and inherits the weapon gems and sockets without occupying a socket. Merchant socket upgrades cost 100 gold each, up to two per card type per run.", "积累经验触发了这次升级。选择一张基础卡。玩家回合有空位时直接入手，本回合可免费打出一次；手满时进入抽牌堆，仍按原费用。随后继续战斗。": "You earned a level. Choose a base card. If your hand has room on your turn, it is free once this turn. Otherwise it enters the draw pile at its usual cost. Battle then resumes.", "演示模式：开放全部已实现卡牌": "Expanded pool: all implemented cards", "资源基础模式：默认解锁卡池": "Original starter unlocks"});
